# AI agents
# Everything under .claude/ is local scratch EXCEPT settings.json: the shared
# permission allowlist (which ops commands may run unprompted, and the deny
# rules that keep an agent off `git push origin main` / `gh pr merge`) is a
# project rule, not a per-machine preference, so it is versioned.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
.gemini/
jago_akademi_clarification_questions.docx.pdf

# Build artifacts & tool output
*.tsbuildinfo
graphify-out/
scratch/

# Runtime database dumps & env backups — P0, 6 Aug 2026.
# The production working tree (/var/www/jago-akademi) was found holding an
# environment backup and nine PostgreSQL dumps of REAL user data, all untracked
# but none of them ignored. A single `git add -A` there would have committed
# live secrets and user records into a repo that pushes to GitHub.
#
# Deliberately NOT `*.sql`: 14 Prisma migrations plus 3 helper queries in
# scripts/ are source code and must stay tracked. Verified before adding these
# lines — `git ls-files` against all five patterns matched 0 tracked files.
/backups/
*.sql.gz
*.dump
backup_*.sql
.env.bak*
